@startuml
left to right direction

rectangle "Backup N-2 (T-2h)" as B1
rectangle "Backup N-1 (T-1h)" as B2
rectangle "Incident système" as I
rectangle "Perte de données possible\n(RPO)" as LOSS
rectangle "Restauration" as R

B1 --> B2 --> I --> LOSS --> R

note bottom of LOSS
RPO = intervalle entre
dernier backup et incident
end note

@enduml